Adventurer's Guild

205
00:10:57,380 --> 00:10:57,420
Adventurer's Guild

206
00:10:57,420 --> 00:10:57,460
Adventurer's Guild

207
00:10:57,460 --> 00:10:57,500
Adventurer's Guild

208
00:10:57,630 --> 00:10:59,540
Looks like this is the place.

209
00:11:04,060 --> 00:11:05,430
Scary!

210
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:10,980
Welcome! If you're here to eat,
please take any open seat.

211
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:13,960
If you need job guidance,
head to the counter inside.

212
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,440
Thank you.

213
00:11:21,670 --> 00:11:22,450
Hey!

214
00:11:23,570 --> 00:11:25,120
Haven't seen you around here before.

215
00:11:26,300 --> 00:11:29,320
And what's with the weird clothes?

216
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:34,000
Oh, we've actually come a long way,
and we just got into town.

217
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:39,470
I want to become an adventurer
to fight the Devil King's army, too.

218
00:11:41,150 --> 00:11:43,590
Is that right, you reckless punk?

219
00:11:43,590 --> 00:11:46,360
Welcome to the gates of Hell!

220
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:48,720
If you're lookin' for the guild
admission desk, it's over there.

221
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,270
Hey.

222
00:11:54,090 --> 00:11:58,010
How can you make up a story
like that on the spot?

223
00:11:58,350 --> 00:11:59,610
Listen, Aqua.

224
00:11:59,610 --> 00:12:00,320
Okay.

225
00:12:00,590 --> 00:12:04,030
Today we'll register with a guild
and find a place to stay the night.

226
00:12:04,400 --> 00:12:07,520
G-Got it. I don't know anything about games,

227
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:09,790
but I guess that's how it works
in worlds like this, right?

228
00:12:10,250 --> 00:12:12,900
Exactly. All right, let's go.

229
00:12:12,900 --> 00:12:13,960
Oh, wait.

230
00:12:14,640 --> 00:12:17,170
You seem like such a capable guy.

231
00:12:17,890 --> 00:12:21,720
Why were you a shut-in otaku with
no friends or girlfriend before?

232
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:24,930
Why did you seclude yourself every day
and act like such a shut-in NEET?

233
00:12:24,930 --> 00:12:26,870
Stop calling me a shut-in NEET, you bitch.

234
00:12:26,870 --> 00:12:28,890
Don't lump "shut-in" and "NEET" together.

235
00:12:31,540 --> 00:12:34,060
Hello. What can I do for you today?

236
00:12:34,350 --> 00:12:36,810
Um, we'd like to become adventurers.

237
00:12:36,810 --> 00:12:38,330
I see.

238
00:12:38,330 --> 00:12:41,240
In that case, you'll first need
to pay the registration fee.

239
00:12:41,520 --> 00:12:42,680
Sure, sure...

240
00:12:42,980 --> 00:12:45,550
Huh? Registration fee?

241
00:12:46,060 --> 00:12:47,310
Do you have any money?

242
00:12:48,450 --> 00:12:50,720
You dragged me here without any warning.

243
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:52,000
Of course I don't.

244
00:12:52,580 --> 00:12:54,650
This girl's useless...

245
00:13:02,660 --> 00:13:04,090
Are you ready to order?

246
00:13:04,660 --> 00:13:07,700
Um, I'm still thinking about it...

247
00:13:07,700 --> 00:13:08,760
Please take your time.

248
00:13:09,900 --> 00:13:11,190
Hey, what should we do?

249
00:13:11,710 --> 00:13:13,180
We've already hit a roadblock.

250
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:16,000
Normally we'd get a minimal
amount of equipment

251
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:19,040
and enough to cover basic
living expenses, at least.

252
00:13:19,040 --> 00:13:20,520
This is totally inhospitable.

253
00:13:20,790 --> 00:13:23,450
There goes your reliability, just like that.

254
00:13:23,450 --> 00:13:26,130
Well, I guess it was inevitable.
You are a shut-in NEET.

255
00:13:26,130 --> 00:13:27,530
Don't call me a shut-in NEET.

256
00:13:27,530 --> 00:13:30,530
Fine. I guess it's my turn now.

257
00:13:30,790 --> 00:13:33,010
Let me show you what a goddess can do!

258
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:39,920
You there, priest! State your denomination!

259
00:13:40,150 --> 00:13:41,620
I'm Aqua.

260
00:13:41,620 --> 00:13:46,130
Yes, the object of worship for the
Religious Order of Axis: the goddess Aqua!

261
00:13:46,650 --> 00:13:49,290
If thou art one of my followers...

262
00:13:50,910 --> 00:13:53,120
It'd be a huge help if you
could lend me some money!

263
00:13:54,100 --> 00:13:55,980
I'm in the Eris Sect, actually...

264
00:13:59,920 --> 00:14:03,150
Oh, you are? I'm sorry.

265
00:14:03,550 --> 00:14:07,070
Oh, young lady, are you with the Axis Sect?

266
00:14:07,070 --> 00:14:11,290
The relationship of the goddesses Aqua and
Eris is that of superior and subordinate.

267
00:14:11,470 --> 00:14:16,310
This must be fate. I saw earlier that
you couldn't cover the fee, correct?

268
00:14:17,490 --> 00:14:21,070
Here. Please consider this
Eris-sama's divine blessing.

269
00:14:21,070 --> 00:14:25,700
Still, no matter how devout a believer you
are, you mustn't call yourself a goddess.

270
00:14:25,700 --> 00:14:28,150
Uh, yes. I'm sorry.

271
00:14:28,150 --> 00:14:29,680
Thank you very much...

272
00:14:33,040 --> 00:14:36,430
He didn't even believe that I'm a goddess.

273
00:14:36,430 --> 00:14:41,410
By the way, Eris is a goddess ranked beneath me.

274
00:14:41,770 --> 00:14:45,700
A believer in my subordinate took pity on me

275
00:14:46,090 --> 00:14:48,410
and lent me money...

276
00:14:48,860 --> 00:14:50,850
Y-Yeah...

277
00:14:56,450 --> 00:14:59,770
Um, we've brought the registration fee.

278
00:15:00,350 --> 00:15:01,960
S-Sure...

279
00:15:02,260 --> 00:15:05,920
Something told me she didn't want
to make eye contact with us.

280
00:15:06,610 --> 00:15:08,670
Allow me to formally explain.

281
00:15:08,670 --> 00:15:11,970
Adventurers each have their own occupations.

282
00:15:12,570 --> 00:15:14,640
This is your registration card.

283
00:15:15,130 --> 00:15:18,430
It keeps track of how many
monsters you've vanquished.

284
00:15:18,780 --> 00:15:23,120
As your level increases, you'll earn
points that you can use to learn skills,

285
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:25,360
so please work hard to raise your level.

286
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:29,360
Now, both of you, please hold
your hands over this crystal.

287
00:15:30,630 --> 00:15:31,490
Like this?

288
00:15:46,290 --> 00:15:49,420
With this, you will each
learn your current status,

289
00:15:49,420 --> 00:15:53,140
so please choose your desired
occupation based on your stats.

290
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:54,810
Here it comes!

291
00:15:54,810 --> 00:15:57,780
Now my tremendous latent
abilities will be made apparent,

292
00:15:57,780 --> 00:16:00,850
and there'll be an uproar
throughout the guild!

293
00:16:03,850 --> 00:16:06,470
Yes, thank you very much.

294
00:16:06,470 --> 00:16:10,190
Satou Kazuma-san, is it? Let me see...

295
00:16:10,190 --> 00:16:12,160
Average across the board.

296
00:16:12,160 --> 00:16:14,410
With the exception of
decently high intelligence...

297
00:16:14,410 --> 00:16:17,560
Oh? Your luck is extraordinarily high.

298
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:21,810
Of course, luck isn't a very
essential stat for an adventurer...

299
00:16:21,810 --> 00:16:23,570
With this much luck,

300
00:16:23,570 --> 00:16:26,530
I'd recommend becoming a
merchant or something similar...

301
00:16:27,470 --> 00:16:30,620
Hey, she's disapproving of my adventurer's
lifestyle right off the bat.

302
00:16:30,620 --> 00:16:31,840
What's going on?

303
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,420
U-Um,

304
00:16:34,020 --> 00:16:36,770
make my primary job "adventurer," please.

305
00:16:36,770 --> 00:16:41,020
W-Well, you can always
change jobs when you level up!

306
00:16:41,020 --> 00:16:43,060
Y-You're right!

307
00:16:43,870 --> 00:16:45,310
The weakest job, huh?

308
00:16:49,260 --> 00:16:51,150
Aside from your intelligence
being below average,

309
00:16:51,150 --> 00:16:53,140
and your luck being the
lowest possible level,

310
00:16:53,140 --> 00:16:56,620
all of your stats are
drastically above average!

311
00:16:57,650 --> 00:16:59,700
What? Does that mean I'm really amazing?

312
00:16:59,700 --> 00:17:03,370
A-Amazing is an understatement!

313
00:17:03,370 --> 00:17:06,610
The mage class, which requires
intelligence, is out of the question,

314
00:17:06,610 --> 00:17:08,960
but other than that,
you can be anything you want!

315
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:12,390
A crusader, sword master, arch priest...

316
00:17:12,390 --> 00:17:14,470
Nearly any advanced class right from the start!

317
00:17:14,470 --> 00:17:18,670
I see. It's a shame there's
no "goddess" occupation,

318
00:17:18,670 --> 00:17:21,680
but in my case, maybe I'll be an
arch priest who heals her allies.

319
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:23,640
An arch priest!

320
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:27,120
An almighty class that commands
all recovery and support magic,

321
00:17:27,120 --> 00:17:31,010
and that boasts enough strength
to stand at the front line!

322
00:17:36,750 --> 00:17:40,120
Without further ado, welcome to
our adventurer's guild, Aqua-sama.

323
00:17:40,580 --> 00:17:44,120
All of our staff will be looking
forward to your future exploits.

324
00:17:45,860 --> 00:17:49,280
Starting off as an arch priest is incredible!

325
00:17:49,590 --> 00:17:54,010
Someone like you might actually be able
to beat the Devil King, you reckless girl!

326
00:17:54,410 --> 00:17:57,220
No event like this is going to happen for me?

327
00:17:57,640 --> 00:18:00,970
It's the adventurer's life for
us starting today, Kazuma!

328
00:18:00,970 --> 00:18:03,650
I thought you absolutely hated all this.

329
00:18:03,650 --> 00:18:05,210
Did I?

330
00:18:12,450 --> 00:18:17,110
Well, anyway, everything thus far has
been basically character creation.

331
00:18:17,110 --> 00:18:20,760
Now our adventure is finally about to begin!

332
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:09,240
Wait, this isn't right!

333
00:20:09,540 --> 00:20:10,850
What isn't?

334
00:20:11,090 --> 00:20:13,150
No, wait a second!

335
00:20:13,370 --> 00:20:16,800
What's wrong? Did you forget to
use the bathroom before bed?

336
00:20:16,800 --> 00:20:18,610
It's dark. Want me to go with you?

337
00:20:18,610 --> 00:20:21,470
No need! It's not that!

338
00:20:21,770 --> 00:20:23,020
Keep it down!

339
00:20:23,020 --> 00:20:24,450
W-We're sorry!

340
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:31,580
We didn't come here to be laborers.

341
00:20:31,790 --> 00:20:34,360
Oh, that's right!

342
00:20:34,360 --> 00:20:38,000
I need you to defeat the Devil King,
or I'll never be able to go home!

343
00:20:44,700 --> 00:20:47,890
Her intelligence stat was
lower than a human's.

344
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:51,990
All of the monsters near town have
been long since exterminated.

345
00:20:51,990 --> 00:20:56,100
With no monsters, there's no need
for anyone to give us any fetch quests.

346
00:20:57,380 --> 00:21:00,280
I didn't want to learn something so realistic...

347
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:01,860
Thanks for your business!

348
00:21:15,940 --> 00:21:16,630
What?

349
00:21:20,580 --> 00:21:21,770
It's nothing.

350
00:21:22,380 --> 00:21:23,090
Say...

351
00:21:24,120 --> 00:21:26,090
I was just thinking.

352
00:21:26,090 --> 00:21:29,300
Let's go away from here and do a kill quest.

353
00:21:29,300 --> 00:21:32,450
We're level one. We don't even
have full sets of equipment.

354
00:21:32,450 --> 00:21:36,240
It'll be fine. As long as you have
me around, it'll be over in a flash!

355
00:21:37,340 --> 00:21:38,690
You can count on it!

356
00:21:39,270 --> 00:21:41,070
I feel very uneasy about this.

357
00:21:41,400 --> 00:21:43,500
Who do you think I am?

358
00:21:44,370 --> 00:21:48,340
That's right. You are a goddess, after all.

359
00:21:48,600 --> 00:21:50,470
Yeah! Leave it to me.

360
00:21:52,170 --> 00:21:55,950
And so our adventure began,

361
00:21:55,950 --> 00:21:58,400
for real this... time.

362
00:22:13,060 --> 00:22:16,850
KONOSUBA
God's Blessing on this Wonderful World!

363
00:22:16,850 --> 00:22:24,570
KONOSUBA
God's Blessing on this Wonderful World!

364
00:22:46,170 --> 00:22:49,180
Episode 1

365
00:22:46,170 --> 00:22:49,180
"This Self-Proclaimed Goddess and Reincarnation in Another World!"

366
00:23:29,970 --> 00:23:40,030
Mom, I've come to a parallel world.
I feel refreshed, as if I've been reborn.
I've found a home and a job, and I'm full of energy.
And best of all, a goddess has come along with me.
So please don't worry about me.
I'll be all right... I'll be all right... Probably...

367
00:23:29,970 --> 00:23:40,030
Episode 2

368
00:23:29,970 --> 00:23:40,030
An Explosion For This Chuunibyou!
